{"resourceIdentifier":"4090","resourceName":"Goldbeck Forest Carbon Project","description":"Aurum Sustainable Forest Inc (Aurum) is developing a forest carbon credit project to generate greenhouse gas (GHG) emission reductions and removals by extending the rotation age of their operational forests. In addition to increasing the age of their forestlands, the Goldbeck Forest Carbon Project (Goldbeck) will be reverting stand compositions back to natural longleaf pine forests where appropriate. Project instances will be implemented in the states of Alabama, Florida, Georgia, Louisiana, Mississippi, North Carolina, South Carolina, Texas and Virginia; of the United States. The project has been designed as a grouped project to allow for additional project activity instances to be added in the future. All activity instances included in the project are currently managed for timber harvest, and all forests within the project activity instances are Forest Stewardship Council® (FSC®) certified.","location":{"latitude":35.146664,"longitude":82.590828},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2023-01-23","endExclusive":"2023-02-23","endInclusive":"2023-02-22"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"4090"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"NC"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Aurum Sustainable Forest Inc."},{"type":"string","value":"Georgia, United States"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"},{"type":"assetSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"4090"},{"type":"bufferSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"4090"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"12871"}]},{"code":"TOTAL_BUFFER_POOL_CREDITS","values":[{"type":"integer","value":38817}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Agriculture F